  "description": "Salvo Bigali, an eccentric Italian who, despite having lived in Florida for three years, still cannot speak English. Although he is a world-renowned author, instead of staying in a hotel, he is wasting away in a run-down Florida motel whilst waiting for someone. Longing for his hometown of Sicily, Salvo hires Ben, a rough-and-ready cleaner he has just met, as his assistant and English tutor, purely because Ben speaks with a Sicilian accent… *(Source: Bomtoon, translated)*\n\nCharacter Profiles\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/misfit), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/misfit_in_paradise)",
